  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Merging hunting with current designs and stylish wear, RakAdx is an exclusive hunting lifestyle brand. Pronounced &ldquo;Rack Addicts,&rdquo; we share that passion through our creativity and quality apparel. At RakAdx we stretch the typical boundaries by creating outstanding graphics then produce only premium apparel that stand the test of time.Our signature urban, patriotic, and outdoor designs are for all occasions&mdash;whether in the field, at the gym, on the job, or for a night out on the town.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description: Lifestyle apparel brand for hunters and gear for the outdoorsman.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): RakAdx provides premium products, delivers the highest quality customer service, and creates a premier buying experience to those that enjoy the outdoor and hunting lifestyle. RakAdx believes in conservative, hard-working, traditional American values. We are dedicated in supporting those who protect and serve our communities and our country. Most importantly, we value our young hunters and support efforts to provide and teach ethical hunting traditions that can be passed on for generations to come.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms: Paypal. Every Friday following 30 days after transaction. $10 Min Payout.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
